<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41474" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιτυχ-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιτυγχάνω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hitting the mark, successful</i> (opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποτυχής,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Sis.</u>
				391c
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			)), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κότος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					744
				</span></i>
			 Turneb.(lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔν τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Div.Somn.</u>
					463b19
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				4.83
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατά τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					5.102.1
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς πάντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>BC</u>
					2.149
				</span></i>
			(
				Sup.
			): c.gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τῶν καιρῶν δόξα</span>
			<i>that always hits</i> the right nail on the head, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				12.30
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-χῶς, εἰπεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phlb.</u>
					38d
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διειλέχθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					12.230
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Mar.</u>
				17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				9.28
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>easy to hit,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔβλητοι καὶ ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>Syr.</u>
					35
				</span></i>
			.</div>
